{"name": "Input", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"92\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/3ad0d4459ef8b35732e842906b410762.avif?t=1772744458\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ONE CHARACTER, TWO PLAYERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Input offers a unique platforming experience where control is split between two players.<br/>One player manages movement, the other handles actions. Perfect coordination is the only way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"340\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/e6370705c9d545ae26759e6f9b5ab48f.poster.avif?t=1772744458\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/e6370705c9d545ae26759e6f9b5ab48f.webm?t=1772744458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/e6370705c9d545ae26759e6f9b5ab48f.mp4?t=1772744458\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TIMING IS EVERYTHING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A single mistimed input means failure. Levels are designed to push your reflexes and teamwork to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"340\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/9ca693cae669c9534b377d2e55b92e37.poster.avif?t=1772744458\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/9ca693cae669c9534b377d2e55b92e37.webm?t=1772744458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/9ca693cae669c9534b377d2e55b92e37.mp4?t=1772744458\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PARKOUR AND PLATFORMING CHALLENGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run, jump, cling to walls, and overcome obstacles. Parkour-inspired levels will test both your speed and your cooperation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"340\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/870e81e1cb4acdc82308dfd6ecf77569.poster.avif?t=1772744458\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/870e81e1cb4acdc82308dfd6ecf77569.webm?t=1772744458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/extras/870e81e1cb4acdc82308dfd6ecf77569.mp4?t=1772744458\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ONE MOVES, THE OTHER ACTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Input is built exclusively for two players. With one responsible for movement and the other for actions, every step requires flawless collaboration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MINIMALIST DESIGN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A clean, stylized aesthetic keeps your focus on the gameplay itself. Each level is a clear but demanding challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One character controlled by two players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Parkour-inspired, challenging platforming levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay based entirely on timing and coordination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minimalist visuals with a focused design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High replayability.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd11 <strong>Input</strong> looks simple but mastering it is anything but easy. Without true cooperation, no obstacle can be overcome.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Control one character with two players. One handles movement, the other handles actions. Precision, timing, and coordination are the only way to overcome challenging parkour platform levels.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016010/755654ac8f69aba9519aa2bb087bfa255be7a8c6/header.jpg?t=1772744458", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Casual", "Action-Adventure", "Party Game", "Puzzle Platformer", "Indie"], "developers": "F\u0131rat Zeren", "publishers": "F\u0131rat Zeren", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4016010", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "21 February 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/Ebk-h8uYjKw", "first_seen": 1771628400.0, "review_rank": 1154}